{"4281410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Strange Horizons", "steam_appid": 4281410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PARANORMAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world on the brink of collapse in <i>Strange Horizons</i>, a gripping survival-adventure game. When a dimensional portal tears open in the sky, chaos erupts as mysterious creatures spill into our world. As a civilian contractor working for the military, your mission is to enter the quarantine zone, recover critical data, save survivors, and uncover the secrets behind the disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281410/extras/3a8b3854b97691d41ae33b9c64c73aab.avif?t=1780942820\" width=850 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BASE BUILDING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive by building and upgrading your base to withstand the growing dangers. Gather resources and craft essential tools, weapons, and equipment to stay prepared. Explore a dangerous and atmospheric landscape filled with desolate buildings, eerie forests, and the looming energy vortex in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281410/extras/1b1f0b2f6c132286894a07e82ad2294a.avif?t=1780942820\" width=850 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face strange hybrid creatures, solve environmental puzzles, and make life-or-death decisions as you fight to close the portal before it's too late. Time is against you, and survival requires strategy, courage, and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281410/extras/b9d9e248914f9ea42ab1c9c1114d00a9.avif?t=1780942820\" width=850 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring stunning cel shaded visuals, deep crafting mechanics, and an apocalyptic setting, <i>Strange Horizons</i> delivers an intense and immersive experience. Will you uncover the truth, or will the world succumb to the chaos of another dimension?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281410/extras/83eca6d42902fda5d7758a4edff52dde.avif?t=1780942820\" width=850 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unknown awaits in <i>Strange Horizons</i>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PARANORMAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world on the brink of collapse in <i>Strange Horizons</i>, a gripping survival-adventure game. When a dimensional portal tears open in the sky, chaos erupts as mysterious creatures spill into our world. As a civilian contractor working for the military, your mission is to enter the quarantine zone, recover critical data, save survivors, and uncover the secrets behind the disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4281410/extras/3a8b3854b97691d41ae33b9c64c73aab.avif?t=1780942820\" width=850 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BASE BUILDING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive by building and upgrading your base to withstand the growing 